{"slug":"l-h-w","ar":"ل ه و","total":16,"core":"amusement; distraction","forms":[{"ar":"لَهْو","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":10,"gloss":"amusement, diversion","word":null,"ex":{"s":21,"a":17,"p":5,"ar":["لَوْ","أَرَدْنَآ","أَن","نَّتَّخِذَ","لَهْوًا","لَّٱتَّخَذْنَـٰهُ","مِن","لَّدُنَّآ","إِن","كُنَّا","فَـٰعِلِينَ"],"en":"Had We intended to take a diversion, We could have taken it from [what is] with Us - if [indeed] We were to do so"}},{"ar":"أَلْهَىٰ","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":4,"gloss":"to divert, distract","word":null,"ex":{"s":102,"a":1,"p":1,"ar":["أَلْهَىٰكُمُ","ٱلتَّكَاثُرُ"],"en":"Competition in [worldly] increase diverts you"}},{"ar":"لَاهِيَة","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"distracted, heedless","word":null,"ex":{"s":21,"a":3,"p":1,"ar":["لَاهِيَةً","قُلُوبُهُمْ ۗ","وَأَسَرُّوا۟","ٱلنَّجْوَى","ٱلَّذِينَ","ظَلَمُوا۟","هَلْ","هَـٰذَآ","إِلَّا","بَشَرٌ","مِّثْلُكُمْ ۖ","أَفَتَأْتُونَ","ٱلسِّحْرَ","وَأَنتُمْ","تُبْصِرُونَ"],"en":"With their hearts distracted. And those who do wrong conceal their private conversation, [saying], \"Is this [Prophet] except a human being like you? So would you approach magic while you are aware [of it]"}},{"ar":"تَلَهَّىٰ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":1,"gloss":"to be distracted, neglect","word":null,"ex":{"s":80,"a":10,"p":3,"ar":["فَأَنتَ","عَنْهُ","تَلَهَّىٰ"],"en":"From him you are distracted"}}],"surahs":[[6,2],[21,2],[62,2],[7,1],[15,1],[24,1],[29,1],[31,1],[47,1],[57,1],[63,1],[80,1],[102,1]]}